+- P2: i686 mirrors of every optimal form (`i686/.../vex.rs` has its own
+  `emit_vex`; `i686/avx.casefile` is only 37 lines — grow it).
+- P3: IR/optimizer/codegen — vectorizer + isel emit the optimal forms;
