+## Notes
+
+- `emit_vex` already auto-selects 2-byte VEX (`mm==1 && w==0 && !x && !b`);
+  the LONGERs come from operand *assignment*, not prefix emission.
+- `vcmpeqps` has no x86-assembler arm (only riscv intrinsics reference it);
